WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.062
Section 5.

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:04.125
The Office Closures.

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:11.062
In 2014, the Harper government closed 9 Veterans Affairs district offices across Canada.

00:00:11.062 --> 00:00:16.675
Veterans in rural and remote communities lost face-to-face access to caseworkers.

00:00:16.675 --> 00:00:20.737
Some had to travel hundreds of kilometres for appointments.

00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:23.562
Many simply stopped seeking help.
